        <div>
          <head n="1" source="#source-34759-34855"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-34780-34801"><rb>八俣</rb><rt>やまた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-34801-34804">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-34804-34825"><rb>大蛇</rb><rt>おろち</rt></ruby></head>
